stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Posted: Web app posts HSM_SIGN_REQUEST
  Posted --> OriginRejected: origin not in allowlist
  Posted --> SchemaRejected: schema or semantic validation fails
  OriginRejected --> AckError: BAD_REQUEST
  SchemaRejected --> AckError: BAD_REQUEST or UNSUPPORTED_VERSION
  AckError --> [*]

  Posted --> Accepted: valid request forwarded to native host
  Accepted --> AckAccepted: extension returns immediate ACK
  AckAccepted --> WaitingForUser: native host GUI displays request

  WaitingForUser --> Cancelled: user closes window or cancels
  Cancelled --> ErrorCallbacks: CANCELLED_BY_USER
  ErrorCallbacks --> [*]

  WaitingForUser --> HsmSession: user enters PIN and signs
  HsmSession --> CertLookupFailed: certificate or private key missing
  CertLookupFailed --> ErrorCallbacks: CERT_NOT_FOUND

  HsmSession --> ObjectProcessing: certificate and key found
  ObjectProcessing --> DownloadFailed: downloadUrl fails
  DownloadFailed --> ObjectErrorCallback: DOWNLOAD_FAILED
  ObjectProcessing --> SignFailed: PKCS#11 or format signing fails
  SignFailed --> ObjectErrorCallback: SIGN_FAILED
  ObjectProcessing --> UploadFailed: uploadUrl fails
  UploadFailed --> ObjectErrorCallback: UPLOAD_FAILED
  ObjectProcessing --> ObjectCompleted: upload succeeds
  ObjectCompleted --> SuccessCallback: onSuccess posted
  ObjectErrorCallback --> MoreObjects
  SuccessCallback --> MoreObjects
  MoreObjects --> ObjectProcessing: remaining object
  MoreObjects --> Completed: no remaining objects
  Completed --> [*]